From 4ba1e6bcd6ed95b9d18108308fd96c5fb97b1f31 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 20:35:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mtd): wrap pack PDF disclaimer and humanise
 export/preview

Word-wrap the quarter-pack PDF so the legal disclaimer is never cut
mid-word and repeats on every page. Render SA105 labels and pounds
instead of raw category codes/pence, keep residential finance (box
44/45) visually separate as a tax reducer, add CSV pounds columns,
and flag already-imported files/rows in CSV preview using the same
sha256 + row fingerprint as commit.
