 mtd/pdf.py             | 143 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 mtd/service.py         |  70 +++++++++++--------
 tests/test_mtd_pack.py |  99 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 4 files changed, 416 insertions(+), 48 deletions(-)

